OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of occasionally heavy rain
OL,7,Fspreading east through the evening.
OL,8,FStaying cloudy overnight with further
OL,9,Foutbreaks of occasionally heavy rain.
OL,10,FWinds falling light later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy with occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy outbreaks of rain at first. Rain
OL,14,Fturning more showery later through the
OL,15,Fday but remaining heavy at times.
